### ─── 🟡 RBAC: FLUJO INSTRUCTOR ──────────────────────────────────────
### Permisos:
###   ✅ courses:* + users:read + categories:read
###   ❌ users:update, users:delete, categories:create/update/delete, admin:*
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Api_HostAddress = {{Api_HostAddress}}


### 1. Register (ejecutar UNA SOLA VEZ)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "instructor@test.com",
  "name": "Instructor User",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "instructor"
}


### 2. Login
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "instructor@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


